    <summary>Lightweight 10Gbps WireGuard VPN, free 30-second Home Wi-Fi device scanner, and Smart-TV ACR telemetry shield for Windows 10/11.</summary>
    <description>SWEEPR VPN is an ultra-lightweight native Rust + Tauri v2 10Gbps RAM-only WireGuard VPN and Home Wi-Fi Security Scanner for Windows 10 and Windows 11. The local Home Wi-Fi Device Scanner (ARP, mDNS, and SSDP discovery) is free to use; WireGuard VPN tunnel access and the optional Smart-TV ACR Telemetry Shield require a paid SWEEPR VPN Pro subscription. Features zero-logs WireGuard tunnel encryption, public Wi-Fi packet protection, ISP bandwidth throttling defense, and zero background bloatware.</description>
